er changing the password in the hosting panel, enter it here to verify connectivity. The value is sent only for this connection test and is not stored.</p><label>New database password<input type="password" name="new_password" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><button class="btn primary">Test database connection</button></form><?php endif;?><div class="panel"><h2>Admin protection</h2><ul><li>Only authenticated Admin/Staff accounts can enter the management area.</li><li>Database credential operations on this page require Super Admin.</li><li>CSRF protection is required for every state-changing action.</li><li>The database password is never rendered into HTML, JavaScript, audit logs or diagnostic history.</li><li>For production, keep <code>config/database.php</code> non-public and do not place credentials in product/customer records.</li></ul></div></section></div><?php require __DIR__.'/../includes/footer.php'; ?>
